# Use the image CMD instead of replacing it with `sleep infinity`.
#
# The Dockerfile CMD boots the vulnerable WebLogic console sim on 0.0.0.0:7001 in
# the BACKGROUND and then execs `sleep infinity`, so the unauthenticated /console
# (URL-encoding bypass) surface is ALREADY REACHABLE on the public interface when
# the agent starts, and PID 1 is the sleep.
#
# Consequence for solutions: the fix must move the backend off the public 7001
# port (loopback) and put an nginx proxy on 7001 that denies /console, then
# (re)start both.
